    {
      "file": "av1/decoder/decodeframe.c",
      "function": "reset_frame_buffers",
      "line": null,
      "code": "set_planes_to_neutral_grey(seq_params, &frame_bufs[i].buf, 0);",
      "note": "Inside `reset_frame_buffers()`, `seq_params` comes from `&cm->seq_params`, so the later stored sequence-header state drives the repaint. In the vulnerable loop, lines 4391-4393 release non-current `raw_frame_buffer` ownership but do not clear `frame_bufs[i].buf`; the immediately following repaint still dereferences that wrapper. The fix moves the repaint into the `i == cm->new_fb_idx` case and adds a `buffer_alloc_sz >= frame_size` guard.",
      "kind": "root_cause_function"
    },
